37
00:00:52,649 --> 00:00:55,157
Tredici giugno millenovecentoquaranta.

38
00:00:55,197 --> 00:00:55,975
A Tours,

39
00:00:56,149 --> 00:00:58,738
Churchill incontra l'ammiraglio François Darlan,

40
00:00:58,912 --> 00:01:00,363
