151
00:03:37,283 --> 00:03:37,805
francesi,

152
00:03:37,829 --> 00:03:38,932
ovunque si trovino.

153
00:03:39,315 --> 00:03:39,907
Churchill,

154
00:03:39,930 --> 00:03:40,987
