236
00:05:38,277 --> 00:05:38,997
Gensoul.

237
00:05:39,438 --> 00:05:41,632
Gensoul rifiuta di riceverlo.

238
00:05:41,681 --> 00:05:42,169
Per lui,

239
00:05:42,215 --> 00:05:43,515
